*.pyc

# Firebase service account keys. google-services.json is NOT secret and is
# meant to be committed - it ships inside the APK and is readable from any
# installed copy. The service account key is the opposite: it lets whoever
# holds it send notifications as you, and belongs pasted into Odoo's Push
# settings, never in this repository.
#
# Every pattern here starts with * on purpose. Google names these files
# <project>-firebase-adminsdk-<hash>.json, so an unanchored-looking pattern
# like "firebase-adminsdk-*.json" still has to match from the START of the
# basename and silently matches nothing at all. That was the original rule
# here, and it let a real key sit unignored in the repository root.
*service-account*.json
*serviceaccount*.json
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*-adminsdk-*.json
